# Matterbending Mage reads only its controller's spells ("whenever you cast"): on turn 3 Bot2 casts Fractalize with X=0 ({U}, a
# spell with {X} in its mana cost) at its own Grizzly Bears in Bot1's main phase, and the Bears may still block the Mage. Both
# 1/1 Bears and the 2/2 Mage trade damage: the Bears die, the Mage survives.

